# 4 zlogin (login.zsh)
# =================
# Sourced at the end of a login shell session. This file executes commands right after .zshrc in login shells. It is typically used for things like running specific post-login CLI utilities or displaying a welcome message.

# - [ ] Interactive (User enter commands in the terminal)
# - [x] Login (The default shell for the terminal)

